NUMBER 07 OF 2018

CONCERNING

WOMEN'S EMPOWERMENT AND CHILD PROTECTION

BY THE GRACE OF GOD ALMIGHTY

REGENT OF BUOL,

Considering:
a. that every citizen has equal rights to live a dignified life in accordance with the principles of humanity, equality, and justice;
b. that to ensure women's empowerment and child protection in accordance with human dignity and to receive protection from violence, discrimination and other violations, women's empowerment and child protection must be carried out in an integrated and sustainable manner through the acceleration of fulfillment and protection of the rights of women and children in their personal lives, family, community, nation and state;
